WEBVTT

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.020
Innsmouth...

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.880
Strange incidents are occurring here,

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.420
at one of the nation's best resorts.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:12.810
More than twenty tourists have
gone missing in the last month.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:17.100
And many say that they've
seen strange shadows

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.060
on the beaches at night, or heard bizarre cries.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:23.620
The Hado Foundation asked me to investigate,

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.970
so I headed straight to the resort in question.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:27.320
So hot...

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:33.700
Over here!

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:38.040
I can smell crime here.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.540
I, Kuro Daijuji, can...

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.760
Kuro!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:46.710
Over here!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:54.320
Be right there!

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:33.280
<b>Ow!!</b>

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.050
Is this all right, Miss Ruri?

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:52.260
Understood.

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:58.100
You seem to be enjoying yourself, Kuro.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.480
But you know...

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:03.810
The real fun is just beginning.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.200
Yay!

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.850
Looks like you're having fun.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.690
Not at all...

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:42.700
What about the investigation?!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.200
O-Of course I'm investigating...

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:47.310
It's so hot!

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:50.580
What are you looking at?

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:53.210
Nothing...

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.070
Mr. Daijuji...

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:57.610
Princess...

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:01.740
D-Don't worry. We'll start the
investigation for real tomorrow.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.450
Forget about that!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:08.590
I trust you.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:10.450
A-Are you drunk?

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.500
A bit.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.530
I see...

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:18.130
Kuro, you're grinning.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.540
No, I'm not!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:23.890
You know, you actually have
quite a pretty face...

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.570
I-I do?

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:30.150
You're so cute. We need to
make sure you take care of it.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.180
Makoto, Chiaki, Sonya.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.460
Turn Mr. Daijuji here into a proper lady.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:37.720
Understood!

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.480
Flight to freedom...

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:43.350
Get him!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.660
Mommy!

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:01.210
I've been tainted...

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.330
Moron!

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:08.290
<i>But this scent of
darkness, amidst the salt wind...</i>

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.560
That was terrible...

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:25.990
Was that divine punishment
for having too much fun?

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.290
Was it?

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:34.610
Oh, Kuro.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:35.610
You're here.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:37.130
Al!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.140
What's wrong?

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.260
What do you mean, what's wrong?

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:40.750
What are you doing in the men's bath?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.190
What are you talking about?

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.610
This is a mixed bath.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.120
Seriously?!

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.280
The water's nice...

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.700
What are you doing?

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:51.700
Did you get excited, seeing my naked body?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:52.970
Pervert.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.130
Say something, would you?

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.130
So, Al...

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:03.870
You're a book. If you swim or
take baths, don't you get soggy—

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:06.250
Don't worry about stupid things!

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.180
Fool!

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:08.270
Jeez...

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:11.170
You truly are a bizarre man.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:17.690
I've lived for a millennium,
and fought alongside many casters.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.600
But never one like you.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.420
Yeah?

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:25.220
A grimoire and caster merely use one another.

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:29.400
Up until now, my masters have
treated me only as a weapon.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:32.430
But you almost... Almost...

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.540
What are you doing, Mr. Daijuji?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:43.350
Kuro's naughty.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.910
Get him!

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.020
No!

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.910
We're almost there.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:14.040
You're sure that island out there is suspicious?

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:18.030
Hey, are you all right?

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.340
Being on a ship with a
hangover's gotta be tough...

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.550
As the head of the Hado Foundation,
I have a duty

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:25.270
to see this to the en—

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.190
Don't throw up here.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.390
Are you okay?

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:31.020
Yeah, thanks.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.020
Why are you here?

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:37.930
Um, you all looked like you were
going out to play, so I tagged along.

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:39.530
Jeez!

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:40.920
This is an emergency!

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:41.930
Turn around!

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:44.530
What's going on?

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:45.400
A fire?

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.220
Captain, what is this?

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:50.180
Land people.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:52.460
You are in the way.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.220
Kill the men.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.880
Sacrifice the women.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:20.740
<i>Wh-Where am I?</i>

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.750
<i>Wh-Who are you?</i>

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:36.510
<i>I-I can't move...</i>

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:48.420
Are you awake?

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:49.550
Al...

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:52.900
Where are we?

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.170
That island.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.160
I guess we washed up in
an underground cavern.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.460
Where is everyone else?

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.130
Looks like we got separated.

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:00.120
Oh, no.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:00.910
We have to find them.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:01.440
Wait!

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.480
Look at that!

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:05.480
Th-That's...

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.130
What is this place?

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:18.220
It's no normal cave.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:21.500
It's the temple of a foul religion,
which worships an ancient sea god.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.910
What is this smoke?

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:34.830
Kuro! What's wrong?

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:37.670
I-It's fine. I just twisted my leg.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.240
Is it because of this fog?

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.190
Stand up, Kuro!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:45.820
What's wrong? Is something wrong?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:48.790
Hey!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.190
Kuro?

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:53.100
You...

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:23.830
Kuro...

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:32.600
<i>Stop it, already!</i>

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:41.610
These last two days, I can't count the times
I've gotten the crap kicked out of me...

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.950
Am I under a bad star or something?

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:46.500
Don't be stupid. Get moving.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.720
Losing your sanity over something
that simple...

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.470
That voice...

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:58.300
Kuro!

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:17.290
Woman... Sacrifice...

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:20.220
Offer them to our god.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.960
Get away from them!

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.160
Butler!

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:33.960
Mr. Daijuji, what are these monsters?

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.100
We'll talk later!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.350
Leave this to me, and get the girls!

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:38.280
Right!

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.170
Let's finish them quickly, Kuro!

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:40.940
All right!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.240
Take this!

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:48.950
Who else wants to get chopped up?

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.960
Marvelous...

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:09.930
Truly impressive, Kuro Daijuji and Al Azif.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.860
It's good to see you.

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:14.310
My name is Vespasianus,

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:17.800
member of the Black Lodge's Anticross.

00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:20.180
It is an honor.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.550
Anticross?

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:22.110
So then...

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:25.320
What does one of Master Therion's
mightiest servants want here?

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.710
Just a small experiment.

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:31.660
It's quite a shame. The head
of the Hado Foundation

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.770
would be a worthy offering to a god.

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:36.450
Offering to a god?

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:39.660
You can't mean to...

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.550
But very well, very well...

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.170
There are any number of other sacrifices here.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:47.200
Let us begin the summoning of the god!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:59.790
<i>...ph'nglui mglw'nafh wgah'nagl fhtagn...</i>

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.360
That's... A grimoire!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.760
And this terrible aura of dark
and accursed waters...

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:05.040
It's the R'lyeh Text!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.240
Indeed!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.760
I'd expect no less... No less from Al Azif!

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:09.890
That's exactly right.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:12.930
So you're going to revive the Dark God?

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:20.400
<i>R'lyeh!</i>

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.880
<i>God!</i>

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.470
<i>Dagon! Dagon!</i>

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.510
<i>Dagon!</i>

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:26.620
The Sea God Dagon!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:34.200
Dagon will use the life energy of

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.490
these Deep Ones to achieve its revival.

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:42.130
Now, what will you do?
What will you do, Kuro Daijuji?

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:46.120
If you don't do something, it'll eat you, too.

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:49.030
Let's see what you've got.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:52.230
You bastard...

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:05.920
Butler, get them out of here!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:06.790
Understood.

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:07.730
Let's do this, Al.

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:08.620
Summon!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.490
<i>Out of the sky of hatred,</i>

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:15.260
<i>with righteous rage in its breast...</i>

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:18.600
<i>I take up the demon-slaying sword!</i>

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:25.400
<i>You are the innocent blade, Demonbane!</i>

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:40.230
Kuro, don't let its aura overwhelm you!

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:43.250
It's a servant to the higher powers,
but it was still worshiped as a god!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.250
Right!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.520
<i>Atlach Natcha!</i>

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.730
I'll kill it right now.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:53.170
<i>Scimitar of Barzai!</i>

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:56.320
Foolish.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:00.140
<i>What was that?</i>

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:00.840
Kuro!

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:09.410
It's coming!

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:15.620
Don't screw with me, seafood!

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:20.990
What?

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:25.030
It controlled the Scimitar of Barzai!

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:27.170
Kuro, Dagon's attacking!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:27.800
What?

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.870
Then we'll use Lemuria Impact...

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:30.600
We can't.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:34.950
We need the girl's Naacal Code to use it!

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.510
Then how about this...

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.690
<i>Atlantis Strike!</i>

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.620
Demonbane!

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.760
Kuro!

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:53.210
Damn it...

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:58.570
I'm not... I'm not dying here!

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:02.680
Yes. You cannot die here.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.240
Wh-Who's there?

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:05.050
Kuro?

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.040
You mustn't die yet.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.540
No, you can't die.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:13.570
Very well... I'll help you, just a bit.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:27.860
<i>You seem rather attached
to my Kuro, Tyrant.</i>

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.530
That's all the help I'll give you.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.990
The rest is up to you.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.170
Kuro!

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.880
Al, what are these?

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:48.590
The pages concerning Cthugha and Ithaqua!

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:50.020
My fragments!

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:51.470
New power?

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:53.670
But what are they doing here?

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:54.790
We'll figure it out later.

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:57.700
We're going to use their power to destroy him!

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:58.490
But!

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:00.170
No time to talk!

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:01.720
Don't blame me for what happens!

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.980
Cthugha and Ithaqua's power
will be overwhelming!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.230
Endure it, Kuro!

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.470
<i>Come down to us from Fomalhaut!</i>

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:11.940
<i>Walk on the wind and come to us!</i>

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:18.510
Endure it, Kuro!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:23.210
I'm not going to lose!

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:25.280
<i>Iya Cthugha!</i>

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:26.680
<i>Iya Ithaqua!</i>

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.720
Go!

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.690
Burn!

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:38.800
Freeze!

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.790
That was amazing.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.570
I see, I see.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:10.970
I understand. Yes, I understand
why the Grand Master

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:12.940
focuses on him so.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:14.880
But... Very well.

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:18.760
I've acquired one of the keys for Plan C.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.320
And the day of its activation is nigh.

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:31.550
Everyone,

00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:36.140
cheers to Demonbane's victory!

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:45.240
<i>You mustn't die yet.</i>

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:47.850
<i>No, you can't die.</i>

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:51.730
<i>Very well... I'll help you, just a bit.</i>

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:54.600
<i>What was that voice?</i>

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:57.210
What are you thinking about?

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:02.340
Nothing, nothing.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.830
Anyway, that place is a mess now.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.520
You unleashed Cthugha and Ithaqua,

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:08.840
with no attempt to control them.

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.180
You were lucky to get off this easy.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:13.820
What a pain in the ass of a power...

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:16.450
We should probably seal them for a while.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:17.230
Yeah.

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:26.200
Sorry about yesterday.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.940
A-About what?

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:30.540
That weird fog made me...

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:32.280
Don't say it!

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.700
I've forgotten it!

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:36.800
But I think I need to be straight about it.

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:38.950
In theory, you're a girl.

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:41.700
I-I see...

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:44.960
Okay, then I'll hear your apology.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.020
I'm sorry.

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:48.420
It was an accident.

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:50.470
I didn't want to.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:52.620
Even if you said you'd let me, I wouldn't.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:53.480
Never again.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.700
Ever.

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:56.170
Not at all!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:03.170
What are you doing, Al?!

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:05.980
What?

00:21:05.980 --> 00:21:07.950
W-Wait a second!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.000
Stop the ship!

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.390
Hey, Al!

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:11.460
Miss Al?

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:14.430
Lady Al?

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:58.810
On the path they traveled, the saint turns back,
and is hung on an inverted cross.

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:00.480
It was a deception and a lie.

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:04.030
No god had answered their question.

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:06.140
Next time: Quo Vadis.

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:10.010
If it were all for naught, could you still fight?
